docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I checked the test values by hand: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66 both match half-even.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** #101 targets `main` and is open. The first `open_pr` call timed out, but the PR had been created, so I didn't retry. It had no reviewers, so I requested review from `code-owner`.\n\nNext steps:\n- A code owner needs to review and approve PR #101. I used `code-owner` as the reviewer handle because I don't know the individual's username, so the request may need to go to a named person.\n- Once it's approved, it can be merged and will make today's release. If the release cutoff is close, the approval is the thing to chase.", "type": "text"}]}]}